# far-art policy: image assets are allowed (this is an art repo),
# but each image MUST have a sibling sheet.json or sheet.yaml.
# A naked image (no sheet) is refused by the gate.
#
# We do NOT enforce that at git level (CI will), but we do keep
# the root + tools/ + tests/ image-free as a hygiene rule.
# Sheets/boards/examples MAY contain image files alongside their sheets.
